  "short_description": "拂去積塵、除去鏽跡、抹去歲月的痕跡，溫柔修復古老物件。你可以在《Reshine》中獲得極簡主義的放鬆體驗：使用各種工具，親眼見證經年的汙垢在你眼前消融。無需經營，毫無壓力 - 只有你，以及讓復古珍寶重獲新生的滿滿成就感。",
  "short_description_en": "Gently restore old objects by cleaning away layers of dust, rust, and time. Reshine is a minimalistic, relaxing experience: use a range of tools to watch years of grime disappear before your eyes. No management, no pressure - just you and the satisfaction of bringing vintage treasures back to life.",
